{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Produce of the sun.</b> For the produce of seed and vineyard depends on the sun." "<b>Gersh [גרש].</b> From the root of ויגרשו מימיו (Genesis 49:22). It means that the air is made moist, for its heat is not like the power of the sun. And he said \"moons\" because they renew and are many in a single year."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:26:29.581756534Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}